      ],
      "conclusion": "First-level rows use ActionIconStyle override at 607f810. Metadata fieldOffsetVectorOffset is 2 words, so field i is offset slot 0x10+i*4. Named fixed fields map iconSize24, iconFontSize18, iconPadding10, iconAndLabelSpacing16, titleAndSubtitleSpacing2. Row padding top11 leading4 bottom11 trailing4. titleFont is OpenAIFont based on Font.TextStyle.title3 with regular weight. maxWidth inherits optional infinity.",
      "values": {
        "iconSize": 24,
        "iconFontSize": 18,
        "iconPadding": 10,
        "iconAndLabelSpacing": 16,
        "titleAndSubtitleSpacing": 2,
        "padding": {
          "top": 11,
          "leading": 4,
          "bottom": 11,
          "trailing": 4
        },
        "titleFont": {
          "textStyle": "title3",
          "weight": "regular"
        }
      },
      "limits": [
        "Values are base style metrics. IconSize and iconFontSize are consumed through ScaledEnvironmentMetric in SVGOrImagePart. Do not force a fixed total row height.",
        "Optional subtitle, badge, trailing accessory and accessibility-size layouts remain separate conditions."
      ]
    },
    {
