      "conclusion": "ActionIconButton applies style.padding to the Button before buttonStyle. The icon child reads iconForegroundStyle and then applies style.iconPadding with SwiftUI padding(CGFloat). SVGOrImagePart consumes _iconSize for its centered frame and _iconFontSize for regular font via 7560ae4 scaled metric.",
